# PC card pc-melee-hand (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, HAND-1 to HAND-3, BENCH-157): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 seeds (3259-3264, after pc-melee-dia's 3253-3258), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: haprep writes work/melee-hand-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, et, ed, es); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
